D42A:              
D42A:              ; THIS IS THE LINE INPUT ROUTINE.
D42A:              ; IT READS CHARACTERS INTO BUF USING BACKARROW (UNDERSCORE, OR
D42A:              ; SHIFT O) AS THE DELETE CHARACTER AND @ AS THE
D42A:              ; LINE DELETE CHARACTER. IF MORE THAN BUFLEN CHARACTERS
D42A:              ; ARE TYPED, NO ECHOING IS DONE UNTIL A BACKARROW OR @ OR CR
D42A:              ; IS TYPED. CONTROL-G WILL BE TYPED FOR EACH EXTRA CHARACTER.
D42A:              ; THE ROUTINE IS ENTERED AT INLIN.
