D463:              ; BYTES WITH THE MSB ON. THIS SAVES SPACE AND TIME
D463:              ; BY ALLOWING FOR TABLE DISPATCH DURING EXECUTION.
D463:              ; THEREFORE ALL STATEMENTS APPEAR TOGETHER IN THE
