D555:              
D555:              ; STKINI RESETS THE STACK POINTER ELIMINATING
D555:              ; GOSUB AND FOR CONTEXT. STRING TEMPORARIES ARE FREED
D555:              ; UP, SUBFLG IS RESET. CONTINUING IS PROHIBITED.
D555:              ; AND A DUMMY ENTRY IS LEFT AT THE BOTTOM OF THE STACK SO "FNDFOR" WILL ALWAYS
