D672:                      .subttl NEW STATEMENT FETCHER.
D672:              
D672:              ; BACK HERE FOR NEW STATEMENT. CHARACTER POINTED TO BY TXTPTR
D672:              ; IS ":" OR END-OF-LINE. THE ADDRESS OF THIS LOC IS LEFT
D672:              ; ON THE STACK WHEN A STATEMENT IS EXECUTED SO THAT
D672:              ; IT CAN MERELY DO A RTS WHEN IT IS DONE.
