DA8C:              
DA8C:              ; IN THE PROCESSING OF DATA AND READ STATEMENTS:
DA8C:              ; ONE POINTER POINTS TO THE DATA (IE, THE NUMBERS BEING FETCHED)
DA8C:              ; AND ANOTHER POINTS TO THE LIST OF VARIABLES.
