DB31:              ; IS COMPARED WITH "DATATK"* EACH NEW LINE NUMBER
DB31:              ; IS STORED IN "DATLIN" SO THAT IF AN ERROR OCCURS
DB31:              ; WHILE READING DATA THE ERROR MESSAGE CAN GIVE THE LINE
DB31:              ; NUMBER OF THE ILL-FORMATTED DATA.
