DDDA: 20 96 df             JSR     AYINT                ;[FACMO&LO]=INT VALUE AND CHECK SIZE.
DDDD: a5 a4                LDA     FACMO                ;USE DEMORGAN'S LAW ON HIGH
DDDF: 45 0f                EOR     COUNT
DDE1: 85 0d                STA     INTEGR
DDE3: a5 a5                LDA     FACLO                ;AND LOW.
DDE5: 45 0f                EOR     COUNT
DDE7: 85 0e                STA     INTEGR + 1

