DF89:              
DF89:              ; INTIDX READS A FORMULA FROM THE CURRENT POSITION AND
DF89:              ; TURNS IT INTO A POSITIVE INTEGER
DF89:              ; LEAVING THE RESULT IN FACMO&LO. NEGATIVE ARGUMENTS
DF89:              ; ARE NOT ALLOWED.
