E604:              
E604:              ; THE WAIT LOCATION,MASK1,MASK2 STATEMENT WAITS UNTIL THE CONTENTS
E604:              ; OF LOCATION IS NONZERO WHEN XORED WITH MASK2
E604:              ; AND THEN ANDED WITH MASK1. IF MASK2 IS NOT PRESENT, IT
E604:              ; IS ASSUMED TO BE ZERO.
